Chapter: BvtPowderDemand
  cites Uoaix chapter CompositeGameRules
  cites Uoaix chapter BritainCatalog
  cites Uoaix chapter BvtCheck

 UOAIX-242 D6: the town's smith spends a powder of restoration on a piece whose max fell below its kind's highest, and only
 while it holds one.
  bvt-powder-demand : Integer -> [Console] Integer
  bvt-powder-demand (unused) = act
    a <- bvt-check "the smith spends a powder (item 166) on a piece whose max fell below its kind's highest while it holds one" (cg-powder-due 250 255 1 & cg-powder-due 1 127 3 & cg-powder-item == 166 & (list-at (bb-catalog 0).items (cg-powder-item - 1)).name == "powder of restoration")
    b <- bvt-check "no powder for a piece at its kind's highest, a piece with no durability, or a smith holding none" (not (cg-powder-due 255 255 1) & not (cg-powder-due 0 0 1) & not (cg-powder-due 250 255 0))
    a + b
  end
